: "<span class=\"strong\">\nReceptionist</span>: HomeTec. Audrey speaking. How may I help you? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Arnold</span>: Good afternoon. I'm calling to confirm my interview. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Receptionist</span>: OK. Who is your interview with? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Arnold</span>: Ms. Poplin. <br/>", "time": "1"}, {"image": "engenn2le08ob12re4img01.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Receptionist</span>: Which date and what time? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Arnold</span>: It is on the 9th at 9:00 a.m. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Receptionist</span>: Ah. Mr. Green. I have here that your interview is at 12:15 p.m. Did you receive an e-mail from Ms. Poplin's secretary? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Arnold</span>: No, I didn't. OK. So, my interview is at 12:15 now? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Receptionist</span>: Correct.", "time": "12000"}, {"image": "engenn2le08ob12re4img01.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Arnold</span>: The office's address is 333 Bristow Road right? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Receptionist</span>: Yes. I can send you an e-mail with all this information. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Arnold</span>: Thank you. <br/>", "time": "33000"}], "coverimg": "engenn2le08ob12re4img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": ""}, {"id": 4, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn2le08ob12re4aud02", "images": [], "coverimg": "engenn2le08ob12re4img02.jpg"}, "type": "picture"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": ""}, {"id": 5, "contents": [{"value": "engenn2le08ob12re5img01.jpg", "type": "img"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "static", "title": ""}, {"id": 6, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn2le08ob12re6aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn2le08ob12re6img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Larissa</span>: How did your interview go? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Arnold</span>: It was good. I think I did well. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Larissa</span>: Really? That's wonderful. I'm glad to hear that. <br/>", "time": "1"}, {"image": "engenn2le08ob12re6img01.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Arnold</span>: Yes, I was nervous but Mr. Sam was understanding. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Larissa</span>: That's fantastic news! Sometimes, they're mean. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Arnold</span>: Yeah.", "time": "9000"}], "coverimg": "engenn2le08ob12re6img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": ""}, {"id": 8, "contents": [{"value": "Hello Peter. This is Mr Thomson. We regret to inform you that you are not the candidate we are looking for right now. Let's talk. Give me a call back as soon as possible.", "type": "p"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "text", "title": ""}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "id": 0}]}